	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Non potui adhuc, vir clarissime, tuis novissimis literis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>respondere, nec hodie licet propter innumera <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>negocia et <placeName ref="l832">Gallicos</placeName> tumultus, quos si scirem diutius <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>durare et ecclesiae hoc nebuloso tempore non posse prodesse, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>certe huic legationi renunciarem.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Video enim r[egiam] m[aiestatem] non <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tantum pro negociis <placeName ref="l862">Helveticis</placeName>, sed fere pro omnibus aliis in <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>me respicere et nihil velle me inconsulto agere.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Sed tantam <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>provinciam non possum ferre et humeri mei illam recusant.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Quum <persName>Mavilliacus</persName> esset apud Cesarem legatus, melius <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>mecum agebatur, quod de multis scriberet, que iam mihi uni <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>commissa sunt, homin certe maxime valetudinario, mallemque <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quietus domi agere, quam tantis et seriis negociis obrui.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Intellexisti, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>puto, a legatis <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinis</placeName>, quod in causa concilii <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentini</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>actum sit; mitto tamen exemplar literarum, quas r[egia] m[aiestas] <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>in hoc negocio in novissimis comitiis offerri iussit; <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>eas Germanice per interpretes regios curavi describi.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/><persName>Rex</persName> ma<note type="margin">a.R.: ..., regia maiestas od. magnam?</note> dedit operam, ut responderetur calumni[i]s Cesaris <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>de adventu <placeName ref="l2510">Turcae</placeName> in christianum orbem.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Libellus ad <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>me missus est; sed quia est <placeName ref="l832">Gallice</placeName> scriptus, ad te non mitto; <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sed brevi fiet <placeName ref="l822">Germanicus</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quantum ad privillegium <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>attinet De animalibus, necesse est, ut doctor ille <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>medicus memoriale adhuc mittat; nam secretarius, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>cui iniunctum erat expedire privillegium, ab aula discedens <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ad me scripserit, quod propter absentiam cancellarii <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>non potuisset mittere, et ne res maneret infecta dedisse <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>curam genero suo, qui primo tempore ad me mitteret.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Quod cum urgerem per unum ex meis, quem in aulam <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>misi, non potuit inveniri memoriale, et perditum puto <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>in tanta chartarum numero.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quare rogo, ut illico ad <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>me mittatur, et curabo privillegium expediri, ut mihi <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>promissum est.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Nunc Cameracum in <placeName>Sabodia</placeName> proficiscor <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>propter subcensionem militum <placeName ref="l862">Helveticorum</placeName> iussu r[egiae] m[aiestatis] <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>nec potero redire ante tres hebdomadas.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Si quid a me <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>scribere velis, poteris ad <persName ref="p540">Calvinum</persName> mittere; nam per Gebenas <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>sum transiturus.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l760">Solodori</placeName> 4. decembris 1551.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Tuus ex animo <lb xml:id="p1z37"/><persName ref="p944">Maurilius Musaeus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse von anderer Hand:]</note>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Dem hochgelertenn, <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>fromenn, fürnemenn, <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>wysen herren <persName ref="p495">Heinrychen <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>Bullingern</persName>, verkhünder <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>des göttlichen wortts <lb xml:id="p4z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürych</placeName>, minem günstigen, <lb xml:id="p4z7"/>liebenn herren.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p4z8"/><placeName ref="l587">Züryc<lb xml:id="p4z9"/>h</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="author">[Darunter von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand:]</note>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p4z10"/>In decembri <lb xml:id="p4z11"/>1551<lb xml:id="p4z12"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
